    "q-52907": {
      "dom_id": "step-q52907",
      "name": "Question 3",
      "problem": "![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14193271/assets/88c545b9f94d8ada244caf648dd4a820ef717258bcd59745a3e5bcf3c71d2167.png)\n\nFor the quadrilateral above, determine the measure of the exterior angle of $∠D.$",
      "worked_solution": "Let us call $z$ the exterior angle of $∠D.$ Since the sum of the exterior angles of a polygon is ${360}^{∘}$, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{41}^{∘}+{106}^{∘}+{127}^{∘}+z & ={360}^{∘} \\\\ {274}^{∘}+z & ={360}^{∘} \\\\ z & ={86}^{∘}.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
